5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's all do our best to find the werewolf and protect each other. I believe we can win if we trust one another!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hi. I'm Daisuke. I'll... I'll do my best, but I'm not very good at this. I hope we can figure it out together... if that's okay.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello. I am Asuka. While trust is a pleasant sentiment, Yumi, this game is fundamentally about deception. We should prioritize logical consistency and evidence over blind trust if we want to survive.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Please, let us be kind to one another. While Asuka is right about the logic, a warm heart often helps us see the truth more clearly.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's lovely to meet you all. I agree with Shizue; let's try to keep things peaceful. I'll listen carefully to everyone's thoughts so we can find a balanced way to reach the truth together.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you're right that it's a game of deception, but that's why we need to support each other! If we stay positive and communicate openly, the werewolf will have a harder time hiding! Right, everyone?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I guess so. But it's scary to think someone is lying... I'll just try to listen to what you all say. I don't want to make a mistake and blame the wrong person.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, open communication is only useful if the information provided is truthful. If the werewolf is among us, they will use that ""openness"" to blend in. We must analyze patterns, not just feelings.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, there is no need to be afraid, dear. We are all here together. @Asuka, your caution is wise, but perhaps we can find a balance between your logic and Yumi's optimism.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Shizue has the right idea. If we can combine Asuka's logical approach with Yumi's positivity, we'll create a supportive environment where everyone feels safe to speak up. Let's try to be patient with one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's a wonderful idea, Midori! Let's do exactly that! I'll keep our spirits high, and we can rely on Asuka's logic to guide us. I'm sure we'll make a great team and catch that werewolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope you're right, Yumi. I'll try to help, but... please be patient with me. I'm not sure if I can be as helpful as the rest of you.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is understandable, but try to be more decisive. In this game, ambiguity can be as dangerous as a lie. I will focus on the facts, but I expect everyone to be precise with their words.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, please do not be so hard on yourself. Your honesty is a gift. @Asuka, your precision is helpful, but let us remember that a gentle word can often encourage the truth to emerge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I understand your point about precision, but let's remember that everyone processes things differently. @Daisuke, please just be yourself; your perspective is just as valuable as anyone else's. Let's keep supporting each other.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, everyone! I feel so lucky to be playing with such kind and smart people! Let's carry this positive energy into tomorrow. I'll do my absolute best to help us find the truth! Good luck to us all!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... for being so kind to me. I'll try my best to keep up with everyone tomorrow. I hope... I hope we can all get along and find the right answer. Good night.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"Good night. I will spend the evening reflecting on our initial interactions. Tomorrow, I expect we will have actual data to analyze. Let us see who remains consistent when the pressure increases.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Good night, everyone. Sleep peacefully and let your hearts be light. I shall be praying that we all wake up safely tomorrow morning. Sweet dreams to you all.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. I'm glad we could start on such a harmonious note. Let's all get some rest and come back tomorrow with clear minds and open hearts. I'll be rooting for all of us. Sweet dreams!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Yumi,Asuka,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Asuka""}"
