31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I have some really important information to share... I divined Asuka last night, and it turns out Asuka is the werewolf! We have to be careful!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... really? Asuka is the werewolf? I... I don't know what to think. Are you sure? I don't want to believe it, but if you're the Seer... then we have to listen to you, right?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, that is a bold claim. However, claiming to be the Seer is the oldest trick in the book for a Werewolf or a Possessed trying to frame an innocent player. What evidence do you have beyond a simple statement?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, that is quite a surprise. @Asuka, please try to stay calm. It is a very difficult situation when two people's words clash so strongly. Let us listen to each other with patience.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, thank you for sharing that information so quickly. @Asuka, I understand why you're skeptical. This is a very sudden turn of events, so let's all take a deep breath and look at this calmly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm absolutely sure! I'm the Seer, and my divination doesn't lie! I know it's a shock, but please believe me! We can't let the werewolf trick us into doubting the truth! Everyone, please trust me!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... if you're really the Seer, then it's... it's a big deal. But @Asuka is so logical, and I... I'm scared of making a mistake. What should we do? I'll follow what the majority thinks is right...","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, following the majority is a dangerous strategy when the majority is being manipulated. @Yumi, your insistence on ""trust"" is exactly the emotional appeal I warned about. A real Seer would provide a logical basis for their claim, not just demand faith.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, your conviction is very strong, and @Asuka, your caution is as sharp as ever. It is heartbreaking to see such discord so soon. Let us look past the anger and seek the sincerity in each other's voices.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please try to stay calm. It's hard to tell who is being sincere right now. @Daisuke, it's okay to be unsure. Let's think about whether Yumi's claim feels natural or if it's too sudden.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, it's not an emotional appeal, it's the truth! I'm being honest because I care about all of you! If I were the werewolf, why would I reveal myself as the Seer so early? Please, everyone, we have to act now!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,@Yumi... you're so sure... but @Asuka's points make me nervous. I... I really don't want to vote for someone who's innocent. Does anyone else have a feeling about this? I'm just... so confused.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, revealing yourself early is a classic tactic to seize control of the narrative and force a quick execution before others can analyze the situation. It is a strategic move, not a proof of innocence. Logic dictates we question the source.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, your passion is clear, but @Asuka's words also carry weight. It is so sad to see you both at odds. Perhaps we can all take a moment to listen to our hearts? Who feels most sincere?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, @Asuka, please let's not let this turn into a fight. @Daisuke, your confusion is natural. Since we only have a few turns left, we should consider if there's any other way to verify this before we vote.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you can keep using logic, but the fact is you're the werewolf! I'm telling the truth because I want to protect everyone! Please, everyone, let's trust my vision and vote for Asuka! We can win this right now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi... you're so certain, and I want to believe you... but @Asuka's arguments are also scary. I... I can't decide on my own. I'll just... I'll vote for whoever seems most likely to be the werewolf. I'm sorry...","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, your desperation to rush this vote is the most telling evidence here. If you are the werewolf, you've successfully isolated me. I will vote based on the lack of evidence for your claim. Logic over emotion, everyone.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is truly a sorrowful day when we must choose between our friends. @Yumi, your heart seems so earnest, yet @Asuka's words are so steady. I shall vote with a heavy heart, guided by who feels most sincere.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"It's a very difficult choice. @Yumi, your conviction is strong, but @Asuka's caution is also valid. I want us to remain harmonious, but we must be careful. I'll cast my vote based on who I believe is being most honest.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
